  "published": "2026-10-24T13:51:40.493Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New: Word wrap (WordWrap), also for very large documents and very long lines\n\t\t\tNew: Touch and pen support (tap, double/triple tap, long press selection, pinch zoom)\n\t\t\tNew: IME input (Japanese, Chinese, Korean) and full emoji support\n\t\t\tNew: Smooth scrolling, wheel acceleration, diagonal touchpad scrolling, touchpad pinch zoom\n\t\t\tNew: Batched undo (UndoBatching), Dispose(), Delete(), GetLineFromPoint(), ScrollIntoViewHorizontallyCentered()\n\t\t\tNew: Native AOT compatible, log file and generic language independent syntax highlighting\n\t\t\tImproved: Much faster editing of long lines and lower undo memory usage\n\t\t\tImproved: Syntax highlighting accuracy and performance for all languages\n\t\t\tChanged: JSON languages load via System.Text.Json, Newtonsoft.Json dependency removed\n\t\t\tChanged: AddLines throws for lines containing line breaks\n\t\t\tFixed: Many undo/redo, selection, cursor, word wrap, zoom and scrolling bugs\n\t\t\tFixed: Memory leaks after closing tabs, theme changes, double right click menu\n\t\t\tFull changelog: https://github.com/FrozenAssassine/TextControlBox-WinUI/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
